{"id":"revista","lemma":"revista","pos":"noun","rank":1607,"glosses":["magazine","revue"],"ipa":"/reˈbista/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"revistas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/91/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-revista.wav","examples":[{"text":"Estoy leyendo una revista.","en":"I am reading a magazine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1187921"},{"text":"¿A qué revistas estás subscrito?","en":"What magazines do you subscribe to?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/28306"},{"text":"Le compré una revista.","en":"I bought him a magazine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460953"},{"text":"Hay algunas revistas en mi habitación.","en":"There are some magazines in my room.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/615922"},{"text":"No tire esta revista.","en":"Don't throw away this magazine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599135"}]}